---
import BaseLayout from "@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for AI Career Guide."
>
  <div
    class="legal-page-premium max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 prose"
  >
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 24, 2026</p>
    <p>
      AI Career Guide is a content-focused website for learning AI, building
      projects, and navigating technical careers. This policy describes the data
      practices currently used by the site.
    </p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><ul>
      <li>No contact-form submissions are stored by this site.</li><li>
        Your theme preference may be stored locally in your browser using <code
          >localStorage</code
        >.
      </li><li>
        Google Analytics may process website usage data to understand site usage
        and improve the website.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>External services</h2><p>
      The site links to third-party tools, resources, and websites. Those
      services have their own privacy policies and data practices.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>
      The site's theme and roadmap progress preferences are stored locally in
      your browser. Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies to measure
      site usage.
    </p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>
      This policy may be updated when data practices change. The effective date
      will be updated after material changes.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>
      Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for privacy questions or correction
      requests.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
